# Absolute paths to back up (one per line). Copied to /etc/nas-backup.d/lwm.conf
# on the Oracle box; nas-backup.sh (game-servers/shared) mirrors each one to the
# Synology NAS as rsync-backups/oracle/lwm/<basename>/ every 2 hours.
#
# Only the rotating snapshots are mirrored, not the live data/ dir: the live DB
# can be mid-write, and data/caddy holds TLS certs that Let's Encrypt reissues.
/home/ubuntu/lastwar-alliance-manager/backups
